Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:03.28,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:03.28,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}5-7 6-2 6-2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 高芙 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:03.30,EN,,0,0,0,,A superb win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场精彩的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.82,EN,,0,0,0,,And when she's in that form,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,她进入这种状态的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:07.06,EN,,0,0,0,,she's unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:07.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,没人能挡得住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena, I said it last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 我昨晚说过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm saying it again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚我还要再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.54,EN,,0,0,0,,You have ice in your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的血管里全是冰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.78,EN,,0,0,0,,What a performance yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,又是一次了不起的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.74,EN,,0,0,0,,The crowd still here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,看台上还坐满了人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.86,EN,,0,0,0,,to make sure they can cheer you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是为了给你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:22.42,EN,,0,0,0,,You spent 11 and a half hours on the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:22.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一届赛事里 你已经
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.38,EN,,0,0,0,,at this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上站了11个半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.34,EN,,0,0,0,,It's 1:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Eastern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,美东时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.26,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you maintain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么保持住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:28.18,EN,,0,0,0,,your focus despite what I'd imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:28.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,专注力的 我猜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.62,EN,,0,0,0,,is some fatigue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,你肯定很累了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know. I feel like uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 我感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:34.18,EN,,0,0,0,,as you said I stayed so many hours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像你说的 呆了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:36.10,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court that maybe some shots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上 可能有些球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.70,EN,,0,0,0,,are just coming out from my racket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,就这样自己从球拍里飞出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh also at important moment I got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:42.82,EN,,0,0,0,,a bit lucky with the line on the return
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发球判线上也沾了点运气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:45.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh again was just trying to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是一直在拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:48.10,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh guys thank you so much for staying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家留到这么晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:52.94,EN,,0,0,0,,so late it's been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天真是漫长的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.26,EN,,0,0,0,,The last time you played Coco
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,你上一次和高芙交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.62,EN,,0,0,0,,was in Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是在多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.14,EN,,0,0,0,,It also went three sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场也打了三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.82,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you operate knowing the margin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道对她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:03.22,EN,,0,0,0,,for error is so small against her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,容错空间很小 是怎么应对的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:04.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 确实是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:05.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Last time we played,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们上次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:06.90,EN,,0,0,0,,it was also such a battle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是一场恶战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.58,EN,,0,0,0,,and even in the on the practices,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,就连平时一起训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:12.18,EN,,0,0,0,,it's always kind of close uh close matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:12.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,打起来也总是很胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:15.22,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh yeah, I was just trying to focus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:15.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就尽量专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.30,EN,,0,0,0,,my serve helped me especially in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球在最后帮了我很大的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.10,EN,,0,0,0,,And I feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:21.14,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first set we were uh playing both well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,首盘我们俩都打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,but then I rushed a little bit and uh uh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我有点着急
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.34,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that I managed to win again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴自己还是赢了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.18,EN,,0,0,0,,in three sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,打满三盘的这场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:30.02,EN,,0,0,0,,You were so close to being a finalist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,你去年夏天在蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:31.30,EN,,0,0,0,,in Montreal last summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,差一点就打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:33.14,EN,,0,0,0,,You were a finalist here in Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:33.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,这次在多伦多 你真的打进了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:33.78,EN,,0,0,0,,How proud are you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周你拼出来的这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.94,EN,,0,0,0,,of the fight you've shown this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你有多骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:39.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:39.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:43.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Very proud. Also also with team I think we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常骄傲 而且和团队一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:45.78,EN,,0,0,0,,did a great uh preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们准备得也很充分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:47.70,EN,,0,0,0,,So now the most important just to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在最重要的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:49.78,EN,,0,0,0,,on going no matter of the result tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管明天结果如何都要往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Just try to to enjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是尽量去享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh yeah keep keep on playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.54,EN,,0,0,0,,keep on trying and hopefully go deep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直去拼 希望在每一站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:56.74,EN,,0,0,0,,on all the tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,都能走得更远一些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:58.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Elena, go rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:58.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,好了 埃琳娜 去好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.06,EN,,0,0,0,,You've earned it and you'll fight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:01:59.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你应得的 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:00.10,EN,,0,0,0,,for the title tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:00.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还要为冠军再拼一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:00.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢你们
